course and has updated the online course materials. For those interested 
the slides are available at http://tresys.com/selinux/.

The feedback we got was very positive and we believe this course is 
helping spread SELinux use throughout the industry. This is not an 
introductory course and is primarily suitable for analysts, engineers 
and developers with a need to write and analyze policy.

